WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing<b>?</b>

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:30.060 --> 01:35.070
MATSUNAMI WARD FUTATSUBASHI ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

01:30.060 --> 01:35.030
A SMILING REWARD

01:30.060 --> 01:35.030
2nd Period

01:39.070 --> 01:39.870
DREAM

01:39.870 --> 01:39.910
MY
DREAM

01:40.840 --> 01:44.180
Today for language arts, you're all to write an essay.

01:44.180 --> 01:48.550
The theme is "dreams." Everyone must have one or two things they want to be.

01:48.550 --> 01:50.500
That's just bogus!

01:50.500 --> 01:54.380
What with the country in a recession and corrupt politicians?

01:54.380 --> 01:56.450
We also have an aging, low-birth population!

01:54.380 --> 02:12.900
MY
DREAM

01:56.450 --> 02:01.030
No matter how hard we work, we won't get anything back from our pensions!

02:01.030 --> 02:03.630
Dreams are a waste of time!

02:04.390 --> 02:06.580
That's just not true!

02:06.580 --> 02:08.900
Each and every one of you
has unlimited possibilities-!

02:08.900 --> 02:11.280
Yeah, whatever you say.

02:11.280 --> 02:12.900
Hear, hear!

02:12.900 --> 02:14.720
Dreams, huh?

02:14.720 --> 02:17.400
Pure bollocks. Right, Rin-chan?

02:32.880 --> 02:38.880
<i>My dream is to remain intimate with Rin-chan forever and ever.</i>

02:38.970 --> 02:40.380
My dream is...

02:40.760 --> 02:43.970
to become Sensei's wife!

02:44.970 --> 02:46.390
Nope, his child bride!

02:46.390 --> 02:48.950
You're still a kid, aren't you?

02:48.950 --> 02:52.970
Why not? I heard there are men
out there who like little kids.

02:52.970 --> 02:54.360
I'm not one of them!

02:57.950 --> 03:01.080
But you've already seen me naked!

03:01.080 --> 03:03.490
Quit saying things that'll give the wrong idea.

03:04.090 --> 03:08.290
Aoki-sensei and Rin-chan
are really hitting it off.

03:13.460 --> 03:15.420
K-Kuro-chan.

03:20.850 --> 03:22.680
Good boy...

03:23.060 --> 03:25.870
This spot is really soft!

03:25.870 --> 03:27.490
Rin-chan, you're pushing it.

03:28.250 --> 03:30.770
Yeah, it's fun screwing with him,

03:30.770 --> 03:35.250
but he seems like the type who'll flip and take it out on you if you don't let up.

03:35.990 --> 03:39.560
I'm screwing with him... maybe because I love him?

03:39.560 --> 03:40.690
Are you serious?!

03:44.250 --> 03:46.830
When you love someone, you tease them a little.

03:46.830 --> 03:49.120
I...

03:49.830 --> 03:55.710
I... love you Rin-chan... but I would never tease you.

03:56.710 --> 03:58.300
Kuro-chan...

04:02.030 --> 04:06.050
We're just friends, that love's <i>soo</i> not the same!

04:06.490 --> 04:10.810
<i>Ju...  Just... friends?</i>

04:10.810 --> 04:13.810
K-Kuro-chan! Stay with me!

04:14.950 --> 04:19.070
<i>That's right. When you love him, you tease him.</i>

04:19.070 --> 04:21.240
Sensei!

04:21.240 --> 04:23.400
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

04:23.750 --> 04:24.910
What the...?

04:32.830 --> 04:34.670
Se-n-sei!

04:36.830 --> 04:37.840
MALE STAFF ONLY

04:38.750 --> 04:41.850
She's falling even more and more in love!

04:46.300 --> 04:48.070
Kuro... chan?

04:49.930 --> 04:52.700
Cheers!

04:52.700 --> 04:54.190
How're things on your end?

04:54.190 --> 04:57.520
God, the pits! Every day the last train!

04:58.010 --> 05:02.280
I have a <i>real hardass who's training me.</i>

05:06.920 --> 05:12.080
Lucky you, Aoki. Being an elementary school teacher must be a walk in the park.

05:12.080 --> 05:13.700
That's bull!

05:13.700 --> 05:17.760
Just when you think your authorization training is over, they give you on-campus training.

05:17.760 --> 05:20.550
Ten hours a week, 300-plus hours the entire year.

05:20.550 --> 05:23.500
Then there's off-campus training at the Education Society.

05:23.500 --> 05:27.310
They leave you with 30 kids while you don't know what the hell is going on.

05:27.310 --> 05:31.130
Throughout the day the kids have their way with you, and at night you prepare for the next day.

05:31.130 --> 05:32.720
That includes teaching materials!

05:32.720 --> 05:37.730
Every day you're up at 6 AM, back by nearly
midnight, and all you wanna do is go to sleep!

05:38.410 --> 05:40.310
Damn, didja even suspect?

05:40.310 --> 05:42.620
They're really putting you through the wringers.

05:42.620 --> 05:46.010
Come now, there must be some hot teachers working with you!

05:46.010 --> 05:47.500
You'd think so, huh?

05:50.270 --> 05:55.250
Yeah... I guess they're sort of cute.

05:56.780 --> 06:00.760
But they are a bunch of uppity
troublemakers who are too skeezy.

06:00.760 --> 06:05.260
Cute, haughty, mischievous
female teachers that put out?

06:05.260 --> 06:06.170
How's that like, dammit!

06:06.570 --> 06:07.540
Make with the details!

06:07.540 --> 06:09.000
That wasn't what I meant...

06:09.000 --> 06:10.680
Get 'em on their backs!

06:10.680 --> 06:14.430
With those types of chicks, you just shtup 'em once and they're all over you.

06:14.430 --> 06:18.600
You know this guy lost his cherry back in six grade!

06:18.600 --> 06:21.530
<i>If I do that, I'll lose my life.</i>

06:28.510 --> 06:30.940
Man, did I drink.

06:31.560 --> 06:33.750
Let's see, for tomorrow...

06:33.750 --> 06:37.590
Oh yeah! First, today's essays.

06:40.870 --> 06:44.920
Ho-kay, "My dream is... nothing in particular."

06:46.720 --> 06:50.280
"To be president or to be stinking rich, one or the other."

06:50.280 --> 06:53.010
And right off the bat I get the ones who couldn't think of much to write.

06:53.380 --> 06:56.680
How am I supposed to motivate these kids?

06:56.680 --> 07:01.280
How can I make my class more interesting?

07:01.280 --> 07:03.110
Kokonoe's essay?

07:03.110 --> 07:05.970
<i>I want to happily make yummy meals for Sensei.</i>

07:05.970 --> 07:11.110
<i>And at night, I want to make him all better by being his slutty, adventurous wife.</i>

07:13.890 --> 07:16.330
I can feel the beer coming back up.

07:17.480 --> 07:19.800
Looks like Kagami wrote a lot too.

07:20.600 --> 07:26.170
<i>This is my dream: to bestow divine punishment upon useless virgins who see fit to get in my way.</i>

07:26.690 --> 07:28.720
I don't get it at <i>all.</i>

07:29.420 --> 07:33.550
<i>"My Dream." By Usa Mimi, Class 3-1.</i>

07:33.550 --> 07:37.590
<i>My dream is to become a veterinarian.</i>

07:37.590 --> 07:43.060
<i>I want to make animals throughout the world smile and be happy.</i>

07:43.060 --> 07:46.660
Ah, Usa! That's my girl!

07:46.660 --> 07:49.160
All right, got my motivation back!

07:49.160 --> 07:51.820
Let's go another round, shall we?

07:56.380 --> 07:58.550
You look beat, Aoki-sensei.

07:58.550 --> 08:00.470
Oh, I'm fine.

08:02.710 --> 08:04.630
Oh shoot! Here, let me...

08:04.630 --> 08:08.920
Ah, I'm all right. I'll get a washtowel.

08:10.840 --> 08:12.800
You shouldn't be lending a hand like that.

08:13.150 --> 08:14.770
Oyajima-sensei?

08:14.770 --> 08:18.060
If he doesn't suffer a little, he'll never learn.

08:18.550 --> 08:22.120
For his sake, let's just stay quiet and watch over him.

08:27.470 --> 08:31.360
Or rather, let's see him suffer like we did.

08:31.360 --> 08:32.820
Welcome to our world.

08:32.820 --> 08:35.320
<i>world... world...</i>

08:37.490 --> 08:44.070
Kids, be sure to check and review all the problems you didn't get.

08:44.070 --> 08:45.620
What happened, Rin-chan?

08:45.620 --> 08:48.280
You were always good at math.

08:49.060 --> 08:50.920
You think this is funny?

08:50.920 --> 08:53.660
Is Aoki-Sensei's arrival causing you to backslide?

08:54.910 --> 08:57.250
<i>I gotta do something...</i>

09:19.250 --> 09:23.830
Ever since you became the teacher, the grades
from your class have been on a downward spiral.

09:23.830 --> 09:26.130
A-Accept my most humble apologies.

09:26.130 --> 09:30.210
Do you think there is a problem
with the way you teach?

09:30.840 --> 09:35.470
I know there are some areas I need to
work on, but I do what I'm able to do-

09:35.470 --> 09:37.570
What you're able to do is the problem here.

09:37.570 --> 09:41.730
Since you have failed to interest the students, they in turn cannot follow the curriculum.

09:42.710 --> 09:44.730
Am I wrong?

10:03.740 --> 10:06.000
Rin-chan, time to go!

10:08.140 --> 10:10.070
Oh yeah, I can't right now.

10:10.070 --> 10:13.000
Sensei says I have to stay back for some private tutoring.

10:15.510 --> 10:18.410
Waitaminute, you did bad on purpose, didn't you?

10:18.410 --> 10:20.010
Is that right?

10:20.450 --> 10:21.910
What<i>ever</i> do you mean?

10:21.910 --> 10:25.900
Unbelievable! What's so special about that virgin anyways?

10:25.900 --> 10:28.930
He was so useless in class
today it almost killed me!

10:28.930 --> 10:30.020
Kuro-chan...

10:30.020 --> 10:33.270
Just because you love your teacher
doesn't mean he'll love you back!

10:34.630 --> 10:39.690
Yes, yes, my princess. I promise to play with you next time.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.750
Let's go, Mimi-chan!

10:54.170 --> 10:56.170
Wait, Kuro-chan!

10:58.260 --> 11:00.220
What's wrong?

11:03.200 --> 11:07.020
It's just that, it would have been
better if Rin-chan were a boy.

11:07.570 --> 11:12.280
Why's that? If Rin-chan were a boy,
we'd go to different bathrooms.

11:12.280 --> 11:15.990
If we played together, we'd be made fun of.

11:22.030 --> 11:25.180
She's not returning your love too, is she?

11:25.180 --> 11:28.070
Sh-Shut up!

11:29.700 --> 11:35.300
7 X 4 is the same as 5 X 4 and 2 X 4 put together, right?

11:35.300 --> 11:38.010
So the answer here is 2.

11:38.010 --> 11:42.010
If you don't understand this you won't be able to solve the other problems.

11:42.720 --> 11:44.370
Say, Sensei.

11:44.370 --> 11:46.510
What is it?

11:46.510 --> 11:49.960
If I get 100 on the next test,
will you give me a reward?

11:49.960 --> 11:51.520
Sure, I can do that.

11:52.080 --> 11:53.280
Okaaay...

11:54.090 --> 11:55.270
Have sex with me.

11:58.200 --> 12:01.610
There you go again, saying
things you don't understand-

12:01.610 --> 12:05.070
"Don't understand?" Maybe you don't want to think that I <i>do understand.</i>

12:06.950 --> 12:10.440
<i>"With those types of chicks, you just shtup 'em once and it's all good."</i>

12:11.720 --> 12:15.080
Kokonoe... I can see your panties.

12:15.080 --> 12:16.590
I'm <i>letting you.</i>

12:18.100 --> 12:20.110
Owww!

12:20.110 --> 12:22.400
And right where Kuro-chan hit me!

12:22.400 --> 12:25.090
We're done for today. You may go home.

12:26.610 --> 12:29.100
Fine, can I get some other reward?

12:29.100 --> 12:32.390
Sure. I'll think about it.

12:44.300 --> 12:46.950
<i>I should make class interesting.</i>

12:47.920 --> 12:52.380
Eh, here we have 64 marbles...

12:53.380 --> 12:56.380
<i>If I can do that, I'd have no problems.</i>

12:56.380 --> 13:00.810
If you divide them equally among 8 people...

13:02.010 --> 13:05.090
<i>I'm doing all I can.</i>

13:05.090 --> 13:07.390
<i>Still, why?</i>

13:08.510 --> 13:11.890
Sensei! I cannot understand a single thing!

13:11.890 --> 13:14.890
Eh? Um, you see, right here...

13:14.890 --> 13:17.020
Your class is <i>boring!</i>

13:18.520 --> 13:19.870
Rin-chan!

13:19.870 --> 13:22.960
Explain it to us more clearly!

13:23.840 --> 13:27.030
<i>This sucks... hard.</i>

13:28.920 --> 13:32.000
I feel bad for Sensei now that you said that.

13:32.000 --> 13:35.040
Despite everything, he's been doing his best!

13:35.040 --> 13:37.030
That's right!

13:38.660 --> 13:41.800
Sensei, may you continue?

13:41.800 --> 13:44.270
Uh... yeah, I should.

13:44.270 --> 13:48.830
Okay... So you want to divide 64 marbles between 8 people.

13:48.830 --> 13:53.810
That would mean if you make 8 boxes for 8 people, how many marbles would go in-

13:56.040 --> 14:02.750
<i>I said I'd stay quiet and watch over him,
but I can't help being worried about him.</i>

14:05.400 --> 14:08.270
Oh! It's an ammonite, isn't it?

14:08.270 --> 14:11.040
Cool, ain't it? I got some more at home.

14:11.040 --> 14:13.660
Heh, show me some more next time, all right?

14:15.660 --> 14:17.410
Sensei, here!

14:25.740 --> 14:28.920
<i>"Despite everything, he's doing his best," eh?</i>

14:28.920 --> 14:30.880
<i>They sure got me pegged.</i>

14:30.880 --> 14:32.530
Sensei.

14:33.060 --> 14:35.560
Oh, Kagami? What is it?

14:35.560 --> 14:36.780
The journal.

14:36.780 --> 14:38.310
Oh, thank you.

14:38.310 --> 14:41.310
Rin-chan keeps bailing you out. How pathetic.

14:41.310 --> 14:43.390
Kokonoe bails me out?

14:43.390 --> 14:45.820
Hmph, and he had no clue.

14:46.370 --> 14:48.760
Really, just pathetic.

14:53.540 --> 14:55.850
<i>What was she going on about?</i>

14:57.090 --> 15:01.700
All right, noon break is over! Take your seats!

15:05.830 --> 15:09.770
<i>Kids... they're fickle at best.</i>

15:09.770 --> 15:12.590
Hey! Shape up and take your seats!

15:13.020 --> 15:15.360
Class has begun!

15:34.970 --> 15:36.790
Okay, let's begin.

15:36.790 --> 15:39.370
Open your textbooks to page 18.

15:39.370 --> 15:41.870
Let's start from the previous lesson.

15:41.870 --> 15:44.880
You all have already learned the symbols on maps.

15:45.260 --> 15:49.380
But today I will show you some   easy tips to help you remember.

15:49.380 --> 15:50.910
First we have the school.

15:50.910 --> 15:53.000
Speaking of which, we have the textbook.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.390
Speaking of which...

15:58.750 --> 16:04.210
<i>Since Sensei is a bit unsteady,
I want to take care of him.</i>

16:10.510 --> 16:11.030
Aida!

16:11.030 --> 16:11.610
Here!

16:11.610 --> 16:13.420
You did your best.

16:13.420 --> 16:14.140
Izuka

16:14.140 --> 16:15.280
Here!

16:15.280 --> 16:17.160
Keep this up come next test.

16:17.160 --> 16:18.830
Kononoe...

16:27.420 --> 16:28.490
100!

16:31.720 --> 16:35.530
That's amazing, Kokonoe! I knew you could do it if you tried hard enough!

16:35.530 --> 16:39.060
Yeah! And it's all thanks to your teaching!

16:39.060 --> 16:40.810
Kokonoe!

16:40.810 --> 16:42.560
Sensei!

16:42.560 --> 16:45.030
What are they, stupid or something?

16:45.030 --> 16:46.560
Right, Mimi-chan?

16:57.160 --> 16:59.690
Sensei! Mimi-chan's angry!

16:59.690 --> 17:01.950
Aww, and it's all Sensei's fault!

17:04.130 --> 17:05.960
Usa, why?

17:13.920 --> 17:15.470
Aoki-sensei?

17:15.470 --> 17:17.760
Ah, it's been a long day!

17:17.760 --> 17:22.540
I've just heard. The test results
showed that you did great!

17:22.540 --> 17:23.970
Nope.

17:23.970 --> 17:26.230
It's because they did their best.

17:28.160 --> 17:31.090
Do you want to have a drink
to celebrate your success?

17:31.090 --> 17:34.620
There was a bit of a mix-up the other time I invited you to dinner.

17:34.620 --> 17:36.320
That'll be great!

17:38.880 --> 17:40.810
Um, sorry.

17:40.810 --> 17:42.260
There's something I gotta do.

17:42.260 --> 17:42.870
Huh?

17:42.870 --> 17:44.620
Okay, see ya!

17:44.620 --> 17:47.330
Ah! Wait...

17:52.910 --> 17:54.550
Kokonoe!

17:54.950 --> 17:56.420
Sensei.

17:56.420 --> 17:59.860
What's wrong? It's almost 7:00.

18:01.010 --> 18:02.560
Nothing much.

18:02.950 --> 18:07.810
If it gets too late, your folks are going to get worried. You need to get home.

18:07.810 --> 18:11.310
Yeah... you're right.

18:13.410 --> 18:17.070
You know, you did very well on that test.

18:19.430 --> 18:23.080
Whatever you want for your reward, except for <i>that</i>, is all yours.

18:24.180 --> 18:25.540
<i>That what?</i>

18:27.430 --> 18:29.890
I won't understand if you don't talk straight.

18:29.890 --> 18:32.370
Why you...

18:32.370 --> 18:33.550
All right then...

18:35.050 --> 18:36.050
Hold me.

18:38.030 --> 18:40.220
Hold me till I get home.

18:51.880 --> 18:54.190
Turn right at this corner.

18:56.080 --> 18:57.730
Turn left here.

18:57.730 --> 18:59.490
Right.

19:02.740 --> 19:04.700
Kokonoe.

19:04.700 --> 19:07.760
I want to thank you for everything.

19:07.760 --> 19:08.750
Why's that?

19:09.520 --> 19:11.580
Why?

19:11.580 --> 19:13.750
It's because... because of you...

19:14.580 --> 19:16.950
<i>I've been bailed out.</i>

19:16.950 --> 19:18.790
I thought you hated me.

19:19.840 --> 19:22.150
<i>Her... Her face is so close!</i>

19:22.150 --> 19:25.660
Th... That's never going to happen.

19:25.660 --> 19:28.120
Even if I say mean things to you?

19:28.120 --> 19:29.020
Uh-huh.

19:29.020 --> 19:31.370
Even if I don't get good grades on tests?

19:31.370 --> 19:32.110
Yup!

19:32.110 --> 19:34.320
Even if I see your wee-wee?

19:34.320 --> 19:37.280
Th... That's okay.

19:37.840 --> 19:40.270
Even if I touch your wee-wee?

19:40.270 --> 19:41.940
I said that's fine.

19:41.940 --> 19:43.730
Even if I eat it?

19:43.730 --> 19:45.030
You're not gonna do <i>that!</i>

19:45.570 --> 19:47.910
Even if I forced my old teacher to resign?

19:58.300 --> 20:01.040
What you did was certainly bad.

20:01.040 --> 20:03.530
But even so, you are still a good girl.

20:06.610 --> 20:09.080
So, do you like me?

20:09.080 --> 20:10.120
Of course!

20:10.120 --> 20:11.940
"Of course" meaning...?

20:12.290 --> 20:17.400
It's because you're one of my dear students.

20:17.400 --> 20:18.940
And because of that...?

20:19.690 --> 20:26.420
<i>Here I am, a guy with zero experience confessing
love, who can't say those words without blushing...</i>

20:28.380 --> 20:30.200
I love you.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.960
I can't hear you...

20:32.960 --> 20:35.950
<i>...to a girl who's just in grade school.</i>

20:35.950 --> 20:37.610
I said I love you.

20:37.610 --> 20:39.440
You love who?

20:39.440 --> 20:41.970
<i>Of course, I don't mean it that<i> way.</i></i>

20:46.790 --> 20:49.950
I love <i>you</i>, Kokonoe.

20:53.890 --> 20:53.890
Eh?

20:53.890 --> 21:03.900
MATSUNAMI WARD FUTATSUBASHI ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

20:54.550 --> 20:56.720
I better get going.

20:56.720 --> 20:59.040
See you! Bye-bye!

20:59.040 --> 21:01.430
Ah, hey, Kokonoe!

21:01.430 --> 21:03.900
Eh... huh?!

21:16.060 --> 21:18.630
You seem pleased, Rin.

21:19.310 --> 21:22.310
Someone told me he loved me in school today.

21:22.310 --> 21:24.560
Huh, was it a boy in your class?

21:24.560 --> 21:26.340
Nope, it was Sensei.

21:27.110 --> 21:28.850
Sensei?

21:29.570 --> 21:32.710
Hey, can you help me with the shampooing?

